<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id5f2eb372-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1" identifier="/us/usc/t12/s5328"><num value="5328">§ 5328.</num><heading> Council funding</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">Any expenses of the Council shall be treated as expenses of, and paid by, the Office of Financial Research.</p>
